      "body": {
        "en": "*Tani* is cheap and *drogi* expensive; *bogaty* is rich and *biedny* poor. As always, the adjective agrees: *tani aparat*, *droga torba*, *kolorowe zdjęcie*, and after *chcę*, *mam*, *kupuję* a feminine one takes *-ą*: *chcę kupić kolorową torbę*."
